---
flowchart LR
  accTitle: OcclusionCulling · 对象关系
  accDescr: 中心对象与所有直接关联对象；完整保留入边、出边及原投影和注册身份，不递归展开间接关系。
  %% n*/e* 是业务节点/关系，sc* 是阶段关系；layout_* 仅用于排版。
  classDef node_system fill:#EFF3F8,stroke:#3567A6,stroke-width:1.6px,color:#1F3340
  classDef node_component fill:#F1F5F2,stroke:#4B8060,stroke-width:1.6px,color:#1F3340
  classDef edge_write stroke:#2F7161,stroke-width:1.8px
  classDef edge_reference stroke:#7B4DB2,stroke-width:1.5px,stroke-dasharray:6 4
  classDef external_node stroke-dasharray:6 4
  n0@{ shape: rounded, label: "**OcclusionCulling**<br/>启用视图的 GPU 遮挡裁剪。" }
  class n0 node_component
  n1@{ shape: rounded, label: "**per_view_shadow_pass#lt;false#gt;**<br/>绘制相机相关的平行光级联阴影。" }
  class n1 node_system
  n2@{ shape: rounded, label: "**per_view_shadow_pass#lt;true#gt;**<br/>绘制相机相关的平行光级联阴影。" }
  class n2 node_system
  n3@{ shape: rounded, label: "**shared_shadow_pass#lt;false#gt;**<br/>绘制跨相机共享的点光或聚光阴影。" }
  class n3 node_system
  n4@{ shape: rounded, label: "**shared_shadow_pass#lt;true#gt;**<br/>绘制跨相机共享的点光或聚光阴影。" }
  class n4 node_system
  n5@{ shape: rounded, label: "**early_gpu_preprocess**<br/>为当前视图及阴影级联执行早期网格转换与裁<br/>剪。" }
  class n5 node_system
  n6@{ shape: rounded, label: "**late_gpu_preprocess**<br/>对后期遮挡工作项执行间接网格预处理。" }
  class n6 node_system
  n7@{ shape: rounded, label: "**extract_components#lt;bevy_render::**<br/>**occlusion_culling::**<br/>**OcclusionCulling, bevy_render::**<br/>**RenderApp, ()#gt;**<br/>对已同步到子世界的实体读取<br/>ExtractComponent 指定的查询数据，批量<br/>写入转换后的目标组件；转换返回 None 时<br/>移除对应目标组件。" }
  class n7 node_system
  n8@{ shape: rounded, label: "**extract_lights**<br/>同步可见点光、聚光、平行光及矩形光的渲染<br/>参数和阴影可见实体，提取变化的阴影贴图设<br/>置；隐藏或失效光源不继续保留有效渲染状<br/>态。" }
  class n8 node_system
  n9@{ shape: rounded, label: "**prepare_lights**<br/>汇总提取后的各类光源，为视图准备光照<br/>GPU 参数、聚簇索引及阴影贴图和阴影视<br/>图，维护对应缓存及阶段记录，并检查设备和<br/>实现支持的数量限制。" }
  class n9 node_system
  n10@{ shape: rounded, label: "**configure_occlusion_culling_view_**<br/>**targets**<br/>让遮挡剔除相机的深度纹理可被采样。" }
  class n10 node_system
  n11@{ shape: rounded, label: "**batch_and_prepare_binned_render_**<br/>**phase#lt;bevy_core_pipeline::core_3d::**<br/>**Opaque3d, bevy_pbr::render::mesh::**<br/>**MeshPipeline#gt;**<br/>为分桶渲染阶段建立 GPU 预处理批次。" }
  class n11 node_system
  n12@{ shape: rounded, label: "**batch_and_prepare_binned_render_**<br/>**phase#lt;bevy_core_pipeline::core_3d::**<br/>**AlphaMask3d, bevy_pbr::render::**<br/>**mesh::MeshPipeline#gt;**<br/>为分桶渲染阶段建立 GPU 预处理批次。" }
  class n12 node_system
  n13@{ shape: rounded, label: "**batch_and_prepare_binned_render_**<br/>**phase#lt;bevy_pbr::render::light::**<br/>**Shadow, bevy_pbr::render::mesh::**<br/>**MeshPipeline#gt;**<br/>为分桶渲染阶段建立 GPU 预处理批次。" }
  class n13 node_system
  n14@{ shape: rounded, label: "**batch_and_prepare_binned_render_**<br/>**phase#lt;bevy_core_pipeline::deferred::**<br/>**Opaque3dDeferred, bevy_pbr::render::**<br/>**mesh::MeshPipeline#gt;**<br/>为分桶渲染阶段建立 GPU 预处理批次。" }
  class n14 node_system
  n15@{ shape: rounded, label: "**batch_and_prepare_binned_render_**<br/>**phase#lt;bevy_core_pipeline::deferred::**<br/>**AlphaMask3dDeferred, bevy_pbr::**<br/>**render::mesh::MeshPipeline#gt;**<br/>为分桶渲染阶段建立 GPU 预处理批次。" }
  class n15 node_system
  n16@{ shape: rounded, label: "**batch_and_prepare_sorted_render_**<br/>**phase#lt;bevy_pbr::transmission::**<br/>**phase::Transmissive3d, bevy_pbr::**<br/>**render::mesh::MeshPipeline#gt;**<br/>按已有绘制顺序合并 GPU 预处理阶段批次。" }
  class n16 node_system
  n17@{ shape: rounded, label: "**batch_and_prepare_sorted_render_**<br/>**phase#lt;bevy_core_pipeline::core_3d::**<br/>**Transparent3d, bevy_pbr::render::**<br/>**mesh::MeshPipeline#gt;**<br/>按已有绘制顺序合并 GPU 预处理阶段批次。" }
  class n17 node_system
  n18@{ shape: rounded, label: "**batch_and_prepare_binned_render_**<br/>**phase#lt;bevy_core_pipeline::prepass::**<br/>**Opaque3dPrepass, bevy_pbr::render::**<br/>**mesh::MeshPipeline#gt;**<br/>为分桶渲染阶段建立 GPU 预处理批次。" }
  class n18 node_system
  n19@{ shape: rounded, label: "**batch_and_prepare_binned_render_**<br/>**phase#lt;bevy_core_pipeline::prepass::**<br/>**AlphaMask3dPrepass, bevy_pbr::**<br/>**render::mesh::MeshPipeline#gt;**<br/>为分桶渲染阶段建立 GPU 预处理批次。" }
  class n19 node_system
  n20@{ shape: rounded, label: "**prepare_view_depth_pyramids**<br/>为遮挡剔除视图维护深度金字塔。" }
